    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bad Trip",
    "steam_appid": 3427350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.poster.avif?t=1749595939\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.webm?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.mp4?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Friday night, and you\u2019re feeling numb and bored. Life feels like an endless cycle of frustration and regret, with doubts about your choices weighing heavily on your mind. Searching for either confrontation or escape, you turn to your stash of forbidden substances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a search for relief quickly spirals into a psychedelic nightmare. Your fragile mindset transforms the trip into a chaotic maze of fears and self-doubt, forcing you to navigate surreal landscapes while confronting the darkest corners of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.poster.avif?t=1749595939\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.webm?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.mp4?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing environments that mirror the chaos of a bad trip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shadowy forests to claustrophobic corridors, each setting feels unsettling and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing soundscapes and atmospheric visuals create a tense, immersive journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense first-person horror experience where you must run and search for an escape while staying ahead of your relentless inner demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through interconnected environments, each revealing new fears and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find an escape, or will your psyche consume you in the maze?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.poster.avif?t=1749595939\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.webm?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/c53084365a54c8bbe37773f63f75ec7e.mp4?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Friday night, and you\u2019re feeling numb and bored. Life feels like an endless cycle of frustration and regret, with doubts about your choices weighing heavily on your mind. Searching for either confrontation or escape, you turn to your stash of forbidden substances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a search for relief quickly spirals into a psychedelic nightmare. Your fragile mindset transforms the trip into a chaotic maze of fears and self-doubt, forcing you to navigate surreal landscapes while confronting the darkest corners of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.poster.avif?t=1749595939\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.webm?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427350/extras/f35556654c01ff1e5cdd7b4b1ab19a1f.mp4?t=1749595939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing environments that mirror the chaos of a bad trip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shadowy forests to claustrophobic corridors, each setting feels unsettling and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing soundscapes and atmospheric visuals create a tense, immersive journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense first-person horror experience where you must run and search for an escape while staying ahead of your relentless inner demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through interconnected environments, each revealing new fears and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find an escape, or will your psyche consume you in the maze?</p>",
    "short_description": "A first person survival horror where escape is an illusion. No flashlight, no inventory\u2014just your instincts\u2026 and what lurks behind you.",
